ted to show you guys as hikaru was  leading the tournament when uh  uh when the service crashed he's playing  against daniel dubo of uh mevco on only  chess and it's uh it's a really  enjoyable game very very precise game  for a bullet so i hope you guys enjoyed  and a lot of you guys were saying in the  uh in the live chat that uh okay maybe i  should just have made it the titled  arena maybe you know not not allow  everyone to join uh but that kind of  goes against of what i was trying to do  i was trying to you know it's a  christmas arena i was trying to give  everyone an opportunity to play against  some of the  some of the big names even if just for  the first few minutes of the tournament  because if you lose games and they win  games of course they will be paired with  the winners uh but even that i thought  it was a very nice opportunity for you  guys to maybe face i don't know nakamura  or dubois here or even magnus or alireza  but  i don't know if it will be possible if  they say it's okay and well this was now  definitely a fine stress test uh so  maybe we'll conduct it in in the same  way uh but if not we're gonna have to uh  limit it with uh some sort of an  additional criteria uh maybe rating wise  maybe the other well we will get into  that depending on what they find and  then we're going to discuss it so this  is just a small update uh that being  said uh let's check out the game uh this  is the i think the last game hikaru  played before the server crashed or  maybe he had another one in but i don't  know if that one  was finished due to  the server issue so let's just check it  out hikaru has the white pieces and he  opens with e4 double replies with c5 he  goes for the sicilian defense and hikaru  goes knight to c3 opting for the close  sicilian we have knight to c6 and now f4  going for the grand prix attack uh e6 by  do both and now knight to f3 and do both  strikes in the center with the d5 and  the bishop to b5 so this is all very  standard 