reaming it and some of them were  covering only carlson's games i think  jerry from chess network only followed  magnus some of them followed the players  they like i i decided to  follow someone uh from the top 10 uh  well depending on what the position on  the board was and and maybe if it was  the beginning of the game if it was uh  an interesting position but uh yeah it's  impossible to cover all of them and uh  you're just too spoiled for choice uh  but yeah this was a  very good experience and we will  definitely try to uh prevent such a  thing from happening in the next one  either by uh alicia sorting it out and  seeing what went wrong uh because it  shouldn't be a problem for them so i'm  sure something that shouldn't have  happened has happened or we will have to  limit the number of players by well any  any sort of criteria that will allow  them to to proceed with the tournament  uh so i will keep you guys informed uh  no worries there and well i hope you  guys enjoyed this uh as usual uh you  guys can check two of my previous videos  uh here i would like to thank the jube  mateo uh marchessini yeah andre lozario  eric mumford and timothy rosen for your  contribution to my channel thank you a  lot to really appreciate it uh yeah i  already said you can check them out here  as usual uh and uh yeah i will see you  guys very soon checking up on your  wonderful suggestions and whatever else  happens in the chess world uh  we will see and yeah uh the tournament  continues in january  in a few days we're starting with the  world blitz and rapid championship thank  you all and i will see you soon have a  great day

